# The harness formats its own files. Do not let the project's Prettier near them.
#
# Three reasons, all of which were live bugs:
#   1. Generated views are byte-compared by `make harness-sync-check` and
#      `make ci-gen-check`. Reformatting them makes the drift check fail, and
#      regenerating them makes format-check fail — a cycle with no exit.
#   2. Prettier rewrites YAML frontmatter in a rule file, which silently
#      un-loads the rule. That includes protected-harness.md, the rule that
#      stops agents editing the harness.
#   3. Instruction files are line-budgeted; reflowing them changes the count.
#
# Your own source, tests and config are NOT in here, and are formatted normally.
